 "short_name": "Nketoana",
 "_doc": "Emunsoft 'TAX INVOICE/STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT': header (Account Number, Account Date, Street, Deposit), a METER READINGS table (meter, type, old/new reading, reading date, reading type, consumption) and an ACCOUNT DETAILS ledger (DATE CODE DESCRIPTION UNITS TARIFF VALUE, ex-VAT values, one VAT line for the whole bill), aging and a remittance TOTAL DUE. Fingerprint: Nketoana's own VAT number + 'NKETOANA MUNICIPALITY'. Electricity lines: ELECTRICITY COMMERCIAL >..KVA (kWh, energy -> standard; its description is the tariff), ELECTRICITY KVA (-> demand) and BASIC ELECTRICITY (-> other); meters = the ELECTRICITY and KVA rows. Readings print without the meter factor (consumption = (new-old) x 200); readings as printed, total kWh from the ledger units. Only one reading date is printed (read_end). IDENTITY x_elec_resid_r = TOTAL DUE - Opening Balance - every non-electricity ledger line (payments, other services, interest, rebates) - the VAT line, i.e. the electricity total implied by the bill's own balance movement, independent of the electricity lines; 0.00 gap on all 9 electricity bills. 10 bills checked (one is a duplicate file); 1 bill of a second account carries only rates/services (no electricity row).",
